# Contact form delivery (https://resend.com) — SERVER ONLY.
# Never prefix these with NEXT_PUBLIC_; that would expose the API key in
# browser JavaScript.
#
# Resend is used only to SEND website-generated email. It is not the company
# mailbox — info@thenordgate.com continues to be received via Loopia, so the
# root-domain MX records must be left untouched. Outbound website mail is
# authenticated on the dedicated subdomain send.thenordgate.com, which keeps
# it separate from the normal inbox.

RESEND_API_KEY=
CONTACT_TO_EMAIL=info@thenordgate.com
CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL="Nordgate Website <forms@send.thenordgate.com>"
